THE TREATMENT, and today the treatment also fails. Two identical arms both failing looks
exactly like a clean null result. The arm is self-identifying instead, engine-side:

    records=0  intel=0   on the `[drone] ... launch` line in RUN_DIR/debug.log

records>0 in THIS scenario means the merge did not happen. Discard the run; do not read it
as a control. Read RUN_DIR/debug.log, never the global debug.log — the global file is
